{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07361","headline":"登东海龙兴寺高顶望海简演公 · 刘长卿","name":"登东海龙兴寺高顶望海简演公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朐山压海口，永望开禅宫。\n元气远相合，太阳生其中。\n豁然万里余，独爲百川雄。\n白波走雷电，黑雾藏鱼龙。\n变化非一状，晴明分衆容。\n烟开秦帝桥，隐隐横残虹。\n蓬岛如在眼，羽人那可逢。\n偶闻真僧言，甚与静者同。\n幽意颇相惬，赏心殊未穷。\n花间午时梵，云外春山钟。\n谁念遽成别，自怜归所从。\n他时相忆处，惆怅西南峯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}